    "faq_section_Frg4NL": {
      "type": "faq-section",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_item_jcHn4z": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes settlehealth Health different?",
            "row_content": "<p>Unlike other providers, we offer a complete weight loss programme that combines expert clinical oversight with personalised 1:1 support from Health & Wellness Coaches. Our holistic approach gives you the guidance, accountability, and tools you need to achieve sustainable, long-term results.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_6Leap6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What kind of proof do you need for my current medication dose?",
            "row_content": "<p>To ensure a smooth and safe switch, we just need proof of your current weight loss medication and dose from the last 60 days. A clear photo of your medication box, a copy of your prescription, or a letter from your pharmacy will work perfectly. This helps us maintain continuity of care as you transition to our service.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_rcL3dc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I choose my starting dose with settlehealth?",
            "row_content": "<p>When you switch to settlehealth Health, we’ll ask about your current dose to understand your progress so far. Our clinically designed transition process created by our medical team determines the safest and most effective switching plan based on your current Mounjaro dose. Simply provide proof of your existing dose, and our expert clinical team will guide you every step of the way to ensure your journey continues safely and comfortably.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_PN7p4G": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you support patients across maintenance?",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely - we’re here to support you for the long term, including while you’re on your maintenance dose. You’re welcome to join us at this stage of your journey. We’ll just need proof of your current dose to make sure everything stays safe and right for you.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_3P9CAU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take to switch treatment?",
            "row_content": "<p>Once you’ve completed our online form and provided proof of your current dose, our clinical team will review everything within 2–3 working days. You’ll then have a short video consultation — an important safety step to ensure your treatment is right for you and that you’re fully supported. After that, your medication will be delivered to you discreetly and reliably.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_hxJVcU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I have questions or concerns about side effects?",
            "row_content": "<p>Your well-being is at the heart of everything we do. If you have any questions or concerns about side effects, please reach out to us. Our clinical team and dedicated Health Coaches are always here to listen, offer guidance, and ensure you feel supported every step of the way.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_bUgG3d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is my personal information kept private?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, completely. We take our responsibility to you very seriously. All your personal and health information is handled with the utmost care and kept entirely confidential and secure, always in line with the highest ethical standards.<br\/><br\/><\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_E7kfYt": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I cancel?",
            "row_content": "<p>You can cancel your subscription by logging into your CheqUp account. Go to \"Manage My Account,\" select \"Cancel My Subscription,\" and follow the prompts. The cancellation will be actioned immediately.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
